  "description": "Jung-Woo is a Tamer in the MMORPG Karel's Hymn. While selling off items after deciding to quit, he meets a newbie, \"Charongrong,\" who swears loyalty even if \"she\" becomes popular. He thought it was just a brief, passing connection—but he shouldn't have taken those words lightly.\n\n(Source: Manta)\n\n*Note: Includes five extra chapters.*",
